# Data Uploads Directory

This directory contains uploaded files for analysis.

Files uploaded here will be processed by the backend services for threat detection and analysis.

## File Types Supported
- PDF documents
- Word documents (.docx)
- Text files (.txt)
- Image files (with OCR processing)

## Security Notes
- All uploaded files are scanned for malware
- File size is limited to 50MB by default
- Files are automatically cleaned up after processing (configurable retention period)